@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ktv-nouns`
IMPORT `ktv-annex1-definitions`

-- AIA Khoe Tron Ven V012022 — Annex 6 (Phụ lục 6: Định nghĩa Bệnh hiểm nghèo giai đoạn sớm), the
-- 23 early-stage critical illnesses. One rule per item, numbered as the Annex numbers them; each
-- reads that item's findings record (ktv-nouns.l4). The Annex 1 conditions every critical illness
-- must also meet (first arising, at a Hospital, usual medical practice) are added in
-- `Annex 6 — the diagnosis meets the definition` at the end.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/aia-khoe-tron-ven.txt.
--
-- THRESHOLDS. "ít nhất N" (at least N) is AT LEAST; "thấp hơn N" (lower than N) is LESS THAN;
-- "N ... trở xuống" / "hoặc thấp hơn" (N or below) is AT MOST. A duration the Annex counts "kể từ
-- ngày được chẩn đoán" (from the date of diagnosis) is the number of months a specialist's record
-- states. "Bác sĩ chuyên khoa" (specialist) is a Doctor in Annex 1's sense with a specialty; the
-- records carry the specialist limb as one fact.

§ `Annex 6 — early-stage critical illnesses`

-- src:2296 | Phụ lục 6: Định nghĩa Bệnh hiểm nghèo giai đoạn sớm

§§ `Activities of daily living`

-- src:2423 | Hoạt động sinh hoạt hàng ngày bao gồm:
-- src:2429 | - Tự ăn uống
-- (src 2429-2439: 5 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- The six activities are an enumeration (`Activity of daily living`); a list may name one twice,
-- so the count is of distinct activities.
@ref Annex 6(10); Annex 7(10), (17), (29)
GIVEN `the activities` IS A LIST OF `Activity of daily living`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of distinct activities of daily living in` `the activities` MEANS
    count (nub `the activities`)

§§ `1. Minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery`

-- src:2303 | 1. Phẫu thuật bắc cầu động mạch vành xâm lấn tối thiểu
-- (src 2303-2306: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(1) (src 2303-2306)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(1) — minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery` f MEANS
        f's `keyhole surgery through a small incision between the ribs to treat a narrowed or blocked coronary artery`
    AND f's `medically necessary`
    AND f's `performed by a cardiologist`

§§ `2. Percutaneous coronary intervention`

-- src:2308 | 2. Thủ thuật can thiệp mạch vành qua da
-- (src 2308-2314: 6 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2320 | hẹp từ 50% trở lên.
@ref Annex 6(2) (src 2308-2320)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: percutaneous coronary intervention`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(2) — percutaneous coronary intervention` f MEANS
        (    "(a)" ... f's `the procedure` EQUALS `angioplasty or stenting`
         OR  "(b)" ... f's `the procedure` EQUALS `atherectomy, laser recanalisation or another endovascular technique`)
    AND f's `to treat a narrowed or blocked coronary artery`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary`
    AND f's `performed by a specialist`
    AND f's `greatest narrowing of a coronary branch on angiography, percent` AT LEAST 50

§§ `3. Implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator`

-- src:2326 | 3. Đặt máy tạo nhịp tim hoặc máy khử rung tim
-- (src 2326-2327: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2333 | điều trị bằng các phương pháp khác và phải được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa xác nhận là cần thiết về
-- (src 2333-2337: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(3) (src 2326-2337)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(3) — implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator` f MEANS
        f's `a pacemaker or defibrillator implanted`
    AND f's `for a serious arrhythmia untreatable by other methods`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`

§§ `4. Carotid artery angioplasty and stenting`

-- src:2339 | 4. Nong và đặt stent động mạch cảnh
-- (src 2339-2341: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2345 | (a) Kết quả chụp động mạch cảnh phải có hẹp ít nhất 50% của một hay nhiều động mạch
-- (src 2345-2346: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2351 | (b) Có can thiệp nội mạch như nong, đặt stent hoặc bóc nội mạc động mạch cảnh.
@ref Annex 6(4) (src 2339-2351)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: carotid artery angioplasty and stenting`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(4) — carotid artery angioplasty and stenting` f MEANS
        f's `angioplasty and stenting of a carotid artery`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`
    AND "(a)" ... f's `greatest narrowing of a carotid artery on angiography, percent` AT LEAST 50
    AND "(b)" ... f's `an endovascular intervention such as angioplasty, stenting or endarterectomy`

§§ `5. Minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease`

-- src:2357 | 5. Điều trị bệnh van tim ít xâm lấn
-- (src 2357-2358: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2364 | phương pháp can thiệp qua da. Thủ thuật này phải được xác nhận là cần thiết về mặt y khoa
-- src:2370 | và được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa thực hiện.
@ref Annex 6(5) (src 2357-2370)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(5) — minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease` f MEANS
        f's `a percutaneous valve procedure such as valvotomy, valvuloplasty or valve replacement`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary`
    AND f's `performed by a specialist`

§§ `6. Insertion of a vena cava filter`

-- src:2376 | 6. Đặt màng lọc tĩnh mạch chủ
-- src:2382 | Là phẫu thuật được thực hiện khi có thuyên tắc phổi tái phát. Phẫu thuật này cần phải được
-- (src 2382-2383: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(6) (src 2376-2383)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: insertion of a vena cava filter`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(6) — insertion of a vena cava filter` f MEANS
        f's `surgery performed for recurrent pulmonary embolism`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`

§§ `7. Coma lasting at least 48 hours`

-- src:2385 | 7. Hôn mê kéo dài ít nhất 48 giờ
-- (src 2385-2394: 9 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(7) (src 2385-2394)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: coma lasting at least 48 hours`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(7) — coma lasting at least 48 hours` f MEANS
        "(a)" ... f's `hours of continuous coma without response to external stimuli` AT LEAST 48
    AND "(b)" ... f's `treated with mechanical ventilation`
    AND "(c)" ... f's `months the permanent neurological deficit from the brain damage has lasted since diagnosis` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `confirmed by a neurologist or neurosurgeon`
    AND NOT f's `caused by abuse of alcohol or addictive substances`
    AND NOT f's `induced deliberately at a specialist's request`

§§ `8. Cerebral ventricular shunt surgery`

-- src:2397 | 8. Phẫu thuật dẫn lưu não thất
-- (src 2397-2399: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(8) (src 2397-2399)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: cerebral ventricular shunt surgery`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(8) — cerebral ventricular shunt surgery` f MEANS
        f's `a shunt placed in a cerebral ventricle to drain cerebrospinal fluid`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`

§§ `9. Surgical removal of a pituitary tumour`

-- src:2401 | 9. Phẫu thuật cắt bỏ u tuyến yên
-- (src 2401-2406: 5 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(9) (src 2401-2406)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: surgical removal of a pituitary tumour`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(9) — surgical removal of a pituitary tumour` f MEANS
        f's `the pituitary tumour was removed surgically`
    AND f's `the tumour caused raised intracranial pressure, endocrine disorder or neurological impairment by compression`
    AND f's `diagnosis confirmed by a specialist on CT or MRI`
    AND f's `size of the tumour, mm` GREATER THAN 8

§§ `10. Brain damage`

-- src:2408 | 10. Tổn thương não
-- (src 2408-2409: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2415 | nhất 3 tháng kể từ ngày được chẩn đoán. Tổn thương này làm cho Người được bảo hiểm
-- (src 2415-2417: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(10) (src 2408-2439)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: brain damage`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(10) — brain damage` f MEANS
        f's `brain damage from a head injury`
    AND f's `months the permanent neurological impairment has lasted since diagnosis` AT LEAST 3
    AND `the number of distinct activities of daily living in` (f's `activities of daily living the insured cannot perform`) AT LEAST 2

§§ `11. Small bowel transplant`

-- src:2443 | 11. Ghép ruột non
-- src:2448 | Là ghép ít nhất 01 (một) mét ruột non kèm toàn bộ mạch máu nuôi bằng phẫu thuật mở ổ
-- (src 2448-2449: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2455 | Phẫu thuật này phải được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa xác nhận là cần thiết về mặt y khoa.
@ref Annex 6(11) (src 2443-2455)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: small bowel transplant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(11) — small bowel transplant` f MEANS
        f's `metres of small bowel transplanted` AT LEAST 1
    AND f's `with its whole blood supply, by open abdominal surgery`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`

§§ `12. Liver surgery`

-- src:2461 | 12. Phẫu thuật gan
-- src:2467 | Phẫu thuật cắt bỏ hoàn toàn thùy trái hoặc thùy phải gan do bệnh hoặc Tai nạn.
-- (src 2467-2468: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2474 | chất gây nghiện hoặc phẫu thuật hiến gan.
@ref Annex 6(12) (src 2461-2474)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: liver surgery`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(12) — liver surgery` f MEANS
        f's `complete removal of the left or right lobe of the liver`
    AND f's `because of illness or an Accident`
    AND NOT f's `for an illness related to alcohol abuse or addictive substances`
    AND NOT f's `to donate liver`

§§ `13. Cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis`

-- src:2480 | 13. Xơ gan do viêm gan siêu vi
-- (src 2480-2483: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(13) (src 2480-2483)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(13) — cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis` f MEANS
        f's `cirrhosis from viral hepatitis diagnosed by a gastroenterologist`
    AND f's `on a liver biopsy`
    AND f's `fibrosis at Metavir stage F4 or Knodell stage 4`

§§ `14. Removal of one lung`

-- src:2485 | 14. Phẫu thuật cắt bỏ một bên phổi
-- (src 2485-2488: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(14) (src 2485-2488)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: removal of one lung`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(14) — removal of one lung` f MEANS
        f's `complete removal of one lung`
    AND f's `because of illness or an Accident`
    AND NOT f's `only part of a lung removed`

§§ `15. Kidney disease`

-- src:2495 | 15. Bệnh thận
-- src:2502 | Bệnh thận thuộc một trong các tình trạng sau:
-- (src 2502-2508: 6 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- "thấp hơn 30mL/phút/1.73 m2" is lower than 30 (strictly), and "ít nhất 90 ngày liên tục" at
-- least 90 consecutive days. The decimal point in "1.73 m2" is the medical unit, printed in the
-- international style, not a Vietnamese thousands dot.
@ref Annex 6(15) (src 2495-2508)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: kidney disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(15) — kidney disease` f MEANS
    (       "(a)" ... (    f's `advanced chronic kidney failure diagnosed by a specialist`
                       AND f's `glomerular filtration rate, mL per minute per 1.73 m2` LESS THAN 30
                       AND f's `consecutive days the condition has lasted` AT LEAST 90)
        OR  "(b)" ... (    f's `complete removal of the left or right kidney because of illness or an Accident`
                       AND f's `that removal confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`))
    AND NOT f's `to donate a kidney`

§§ `16. Less severe systemic lupus erythematosus`

-- src:2510 | 16. Bệnh Lupus ban đỏ hệ thống ít nghiêm trọng
-- (src 2510-2513: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2519 | (ii) Viêm màng phổi hoặc viêm màng ngoài tim;
-- (src 2519-2520: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2526 | (iv) Rối loạn huyết học: Thiếu máu tán huyết, giảm bạch cầu, giảm tiểu cầu;
-- src:2532 | (v) Xét nghiệm dương tính của kháng thể kháng nhân (ANA) hoặc kháng thể kháng DNA
-- (src 2532-2536: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(16) (src 2510-2536)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: less severe systemic lupus erythematosus`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(16) — less severe systemic lupus erythematosus` f MEANS
        f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND count (filter (GIVEN b YIELD b)
                      (LIST f's `non-degenerative arthritis of two or more joints`,
                            f's `pleurisy or pericarditis`,
                            f's `renal disorder: proteinuria above 0.5 g per day or cellular casts`,
                            f's `haematological disorder: haemolytic anaemia, leukopenia or thrombocytopenia`,
                            f's `positive ANA, anti-dsDNA or anti-Smith test`)) AT LEAST 2

§§ `17. Temporary aplastic anaemia`

-- src:2538 | 17. Thiếu máu bất sản tạm thời
-- src:2540 | Là tình trạng suy giảm cấp tính có khả năng hồi phục chức năng của tủy xương gây thiếu máu,
-- (src 2540-2541: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2544 | sau:
-- (src 2544-2545: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2550 | (b) Thuốc kích thích tủy xương;
-- (src 2550-2551: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2557 | Chẩn đoán phải được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa huyết học xác nhận.
@ref Annex 6(17) (src 2538-2557)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: temporary aplastic anaemia`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(17) — temporary aplastic anaemia` f MEANS
        f's `acute reversible bone-marrow failure with anaemia, leukopenia and thrombocytopenia`
    AND (    "(a)" ... f's `treated by blood transfusion`
         OR  "(b)" ... f's `treated with marrow-stimulating drugs`
         OR  "(c)" ... f's `treated with immunosuppressants`)
    AND f's `confirmed by a haematologist`

§§ `18. Corneal transplant`

-- src:2563 | 18. Ghép giác mạc
-- src:2569 | Là ghép toàn bộ giác mạc do sẹo giác mạc gây ra giảm thị lực không thể điều trị bằng các
-- (src 2569-2571: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(18) (src 2563-2571)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: corneal transplant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(18) — corneal transplant` f MEANS
        f's `transplant of the whole cornea`
    AND f's `for corneal scarring reducing sight that other methods cannot treat`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`

§§ `19. Loss of sight in one eye`

-- src:2578 | 19. Mất thị lực một mắt
-- (src 2578-2583: 5 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- "6/60 hoặc thấp hơn" (6/60 or worse) on the Snellen chart: a denominator of 60 or more;
-- "trường thị giác còn 20 độ trở xuống": a field of 20 degrees or less. Either suffices.
@ref Annex 6(19) (src 2578-2583)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: loss of sight in one eye`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(19) — loss of sight in one eye` f MEANS
        f's `complete irreversible loss of sight of one eye from illness or injury`
    AND f's `confirmed by an ophthalmologist`
    AND (    f's `corrected visual acuity, Snellen denominator over 6` AT LEAST 60
         OR  f's `remaining visual field, degrees` AT MOST 20)
    AND NOT f's `caused by abuse of alcohol or drugs`

§§ `20. Loss of hearing in one ear`

-- src:2585 | 20. Mất thính lực một tai
-- (src 2585-2589: 4 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(20) (src 2585-2589)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: loss of hearing in one ear`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(20) — loss of hearing in one ear` f MEANS
        f's `complete irreversible loss of hearing in one ear from illness or injury`
    AND f's `confirmed by an ear, nose and throat specialist`
    AND f's `hearing loss at every frequency, decibels` AT LEAST 80
    AND f's `months from the diagnosis to the audiometry` AT LEAST 3

§§ `21. Minor burns`

-- src:2594 | 21. Bỏng mức độ nhẹ
-- (src 2594-2596: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(21) (src 2594-2596)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: minor burns`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(21) — minor burns` f MEANS
        f's `third-degree burns caused by an accident`
    AND (    f's `percent of the body surface burnt` AT LEAST 10
         OR  f's `percent of the face burnt` AT LEAST 30)

§§ `22. Paralysis of one limb`

-- src:2598 | 22. Liệt một chi
-- (src 2598-2601: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 6(22) (src 2598-2601)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: paralysis of one limb`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(22) — paralysis of one limb` f MEANS
        f's `complete permanent loss of function of at least one arm or one leg from illness or injury`
    AND f's `months it has lasted since diagnosis` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `muscle power grade` EQUALS 0

§§ `23. Reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident`

-- src:2603 | 23. Phẫu thuật phục hồi khuôn mặt bị tổn thương do Tai nạn
-- (src 2603-2606: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2612 | thương da mặt.
@ref Annex 6(23) (src 2603-2612)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6(23) — reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident` f MEANS
        f's `reconstructive or plastic surgery of a face injured in an Accident`
    AND f's `requiring admission to hospital`
    AND f's `confirmed medically necessary by a specialist`
    AND NOT f's `cosmetic surgery, dental reconstruction, treatment of a nasal fracture or of facial skin injury`

§§ `Dispatch: which item the findings are about, and whether they meet it`

@ref Annex 6 (src 2296-2612)
GIVEN `the findings` IS A `Findings on an early-stage critical illness`
GIVETH AN `Early-stage critical illness`
`Annex 6 — the item the findings are about` `the findings` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the findings`
    WHEN `findings on minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery` x  THEN `minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery`
    WHEN `findings on percutaneous coronary intervention` x                 THEN `percutaneous coronary intervention`
    WHEN `findings on implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator` x       THEN `implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator`
    WHEN `findings on carotid artery angioplasty and stenting` x            THEN `carotid artery angioplasty and stenting`
    WHEN `findings on minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease` x THEN `minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease`
    WHEN `findings on insertion of a vena cava filter` x                    THEN `insertion of a vena cava filter`
    WHEN `findings on coma lasting at least 48 hours` x                     THEN `coma lasting at least 48 hours`
    WHEN `findings on cerebral ventricular shunt surgery` x                 THEN `cerebral ventricular shunt surgery`
    WHEN `findings on surgical removal of a pituitary tumour` x             THEN `surgical removal of a pituitary tumour`
    WHEN `findings on brain damage` x                                       THEN `brain damage`
    WHEN `findings on small bowel transplant` x                             THEN `small bowel transplant`
    WHEN `findings on liver surgery` x                                      THEN `liver surgery`
    WHEN `findings on cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis` x                   THEN `cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis`
    WHEN `findings on removal of one lung` x                                THEN `removal of one lung`
    WHEN `findings on kidney disease` x                                     THEN `kidney disease`
    WHEN `findings on less severe systemic lupus erythematosus` x           THEN `less severe systemic lupus erythematosus`
    WHEN `findings on temporary aplastic anaemia` x                         THEN `temporary aplastic anaemia`
    WHEN `findings on corneal transplant` x                                 THEN `corneal transplant`
    WHEN `findings on loss of sight in one eye` x                           THEN `loss of sight in one eye`
    WHEN `findings on loss of hearing in one ear` x                         THEN `loss of hearing in one ear`
    WHEN `findings on minor burns` x                                        THEN `minor burns`
    WHEN `findings on paralysis of one limb` x                              THEN `paralysis of one limb`
    WHEN `findings on reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident` x THEN `reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident`

@ref Annex 6 (src 2296-2612)
GIVEN `the findings` IS A `Findings on an early-stage critical illness`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6 — the findings meet their item` `the findings` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the findings`
    WHEN `findings on minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery` x  THEN `Annex 6(1) — minimally invasive coronary artery bypass surgery` x
    WHEN `findings on percutaneous coronary intervention` x                 THEN `Annex 6(2) — percutaneous coronary intervention` x
    WHEN `findings on implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator` x       THEN `Annex 6(3) — implantation of a pacemaker or defibrillator` x
    WHEN `findings on carotid artery angioplasty and stenting` x            THEN `Annex 6(4) — carotid artery angioplasty and stenting` x
    WHEN `findings on minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease` x THEN `Annex 6(5) — minimally invasive treatment of heart valve disease` x
    WHEN `findings on insertion of a vena cava filter` x                    THEN `Annex 6(6) — insertion of a vena cava filter` x
    WHEN `findings on coma lasting at least 48 hours` x                     THEN `Annex 6(7) — coma lasting at least 48 hours` x
    WHEN `findings on cerebral ventricular shunt surgery` x                 THEN `Annex 6(8) — cerebral ventricular shunt surgery` x
    WHEN `findings on surgical removal of a pituitary tumour` x             THEN `Annex 6(9) — surgical removal of a pituitary tumour` x
    WHEN `findings on brain damage` x                                       THEN `Annex 6(10) — brain damage` x
    WHEN `findings on small bowel transplant` x                             THEN `Annex 6(11) — small bowel transplant` x
    WHEN `findings on liver surgery` x                                      THEN `Annex 6(12) — liver surgery` x
    WHEN `findings on cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis` x                   THEN `Annex 6(13) — cirrhosis due to viral hepatitis` x
    WHEN `findings on removal of one lung` x                                THEN `Annex 6(14) — removal of one lung` x
    WHEN `findings on kidney disease` x                                     THEN `Annex 6(15) — kidney disease` x
    WHEN `findings on less severe systemic lupus erythematosus` x           THEN `Annex 6(16) — less severe systemic lupus erythematosus` x
    WHEN `findings on temporary aplastic anaemia` x                         THEN `Annex 6(17) — temporary aplastic anaemia` x
    WHEN `findings on corneal transplant` x                                 THEN `Annex 6(18) — corneal transplant` x
    WHEN `findings on loss of sight in one eye` x                           THEN `Annex 6(19) — loss of sight in one eye` x
    WHEN `findings on loss of hearing in one ear` x                         THEN `Annex 6(20) — loss of hearing in one ear` x
    WHEN `findings on minor burns` x                                        THEN `Annex 6(21) — minor burns` x
    WHEN `findings on paralysis of one limb` x                              THEN `Annex 6(22) — paralysis of one limb` x
    WHEN `findings on reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident` x THEN `Annex 6(23) — reconstructive surgery of a face injured in an Accident` x

-- The item AND the Annex 1 general conditions of a critical illness.
@ref Annex 1, "Bệnh hiểm nghèo" (src 1536-1547); Annex 6
GIVEN `the diagnosis` IS A `Diagnosis of an early-stage critical illness`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 6 — the diagnosis meets the definition` `the diagnosis` MEANS
        `Annex 1 — the general conditions of a critical illness hold for the early-stage diagnosis` `the diagnosis`
    AND `Annex 6 — the findings meet their item` (`the diagnosis`'s `the early-stage findings`)
